"https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/832678740_1826049158819589_5086057522489265058_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=Mzk5OTU5NDExODQ0MjQwMzczOTE4MDczMTQ1ODc2NTY0NzQ5.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjY0MC5zZHIudmlkZW9fbmZyYW1lX2NvdmVyX2ZyYW1lLkMzIn0%3D&_nc_ohc=6qRhD5z6F4EQ7kNvwHhYycb&_nc_oc=Ado0NafrRz1kZvW3OWRW2BVsa-1i6VkbGjnCrzcsUrBihUNuUMkT5S4nubYDjj97_ug&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=Rhdu-FGADGD29-qNi8QqDw&_nc_ss=79689&oh=00_AQRGkGru4-J7lfk7o4R9-yozpCuMrPyIVWEYhpsHdv5D2Q&oe=6AE88C46", "width": 640, "height": 1136, "id": "10", "resolution": "640x1136"}], "comments": [{"author": "evangp0", "author_id": "1729453276", "id": "18097224083133153", "text": "\ud83d\udd25", "timestamp": 1793232222, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "patvdv8", "author_id": "22904078145", "id": "18129992474307920", "text": "a github ?", "timestamp": 1793223950, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "scar_ali_", "author_id": "699363026", "id": "18119109329328327", "text": "Add collision", "timestamp": 1793134029, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "iam_adwesh", "author_id": "50085112781", "id": "17964293226218630", "text": "Bro breeded the cars \ud83d\udc80", "timestamp": 1793127330, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "rrrr.family", "author_id": "2287823975", "id": "17919061287513968", "text": "Real races look past the corner, sometimes multiple corners ahead. I'm curious how best to represent that and how much faster the cars start driving.", "timestamp": 1793117292, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_theodosiadhs_", "author_id": "76230449432", "id": "18105248315004672", "text": "Buddy that's almost the EXACT SAME track layout from my local track", "timestamp": 1793047209, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "mc_dunkan", "author_id": "3495458312", "id": "18150542125562960", "text": "now try to put those weights to cars driving on another circuit: you'll probably find your models are overfitted \ud83d\uddff", "timestamp": 1793013655, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "arnchenkaninias", "author_id": "55979869805", "id": "18113277161139972", "text": "Do they work as great on an other track?", "timestamp": 1792933795, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ibexmw", "author_id": "13321555815", "id": "18092641949678531", "text": "@academaai I've seen many project like this but lack knowledge of the track/ what's behind the next corner. Do you have an idea, how we could have an input for that? I think this would enhance the racing line by a lot.", "timestamp": 1792857008, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "che_rochi", "author_id": "2090620517", "id": "17923803498449546", "text": "Nice\u2026 thought you\u2019ll change the track to see as they perform", "timestamp": 1792842469, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sc1.f1.master", "author_id": "17080671852", "id": "18370043131301236", "text": "Ah I saw a guy do this with Track Mania a couple of years ago.", "timestamp": 1792792967, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "klabauterius", "author_id": "24339918009", "id": "17906967753583870", "text": "Is there also a kind of grip level implemented?", "timestamp": 1792749371, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "richardkasztl", "author_id": "3532492067", "id": "17953145391278544", "text": "Did you use Unity for this?", "timestamp": 1792699256, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "dyk_the_viking", "author_id": "1616748873", "id": "18098783102408533", "text": "Try this vibecoded game \ud83e\udd1f\ud83c\udffc\ud83d\udd25@steerit.app", "timestamp": 1792677496, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeBaajzgEeb/", "original_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reel/DeBaajzgEeb/", "webpage_url_basename": "DeBaajzgEeb", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "playlist": null, "playlist_index": null, "thumbnail": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.71878-15/832678740_1826049158819589_5086057522489265058_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ig_cache_key=Mzk5OTU5NDEx